~ switchedobj=line.bb11_12 switchedterm=1 numfast=1 shots=3
~ phasefast=a phasedelayed=d phasetrip=150 groundtrip=75 recloseintervals=(0.5, 1.0)
! Lateral fuse at the head of L6. WP-U2.1 (r4133): the fuse default curve moved
! tlink->none (never blows) and its divisor moved RatedCurrent->CurveMultiplier.
! The whole protection rung (Fuse U2.1 / Recloser U2.2 / Relay U2.3) has landed,
! so this deck is version-consistent on oracle:"r4133" and the fuse is re-armed
! with an explicit curve: fusecurve=tlink + curvemultiplier=50 reproduces the
! pre-WP r4088-era RatedCurrent=50 divisor, so the three-tier fuse-save race runs
! end-to-end at midi scale (WP-U2.1 handoff restore).
new fuse.fz monitoredobj=line.l6a monitoredterm=1
~ switchedobj=line.l6a switchedterm=1 fusecurve=tlink curvemultiplier=50
